@@ Fe-V BCC Metastable Phase Diagram Calculation
@@ Thermo-Calc Macro File
@@ 
@@ This macro calculates the metastable BCC phase diagram for Fe-V system
@@ considering only BCC_A2 and B2_221 phases (excluding FCC_A1 and SIGMA)
@@
@@ Usage in Thermo-Calc Console:
@@   MACRO_FILE_READ fev_bcc_thermocalc.tcm
@@
@@ Prerequisites:
@@   - Fe-V_B2_221.tdb must be in the same directory or specify full path
@@

@@ ============================================================
@@ STEP 1: Initialize and load database
@@ ============================================================
GO DATA

@@ Read the TDB file (adjust path as needed)
SWITCH_DATABASE TDB
READ_DATABASE Fe-V_B2_221.tdb

@@ Define system components
DEFINE_SYSTEM FE V

@@ ============================================================
@@ STEP 2: Reject stable phases (FCC, SIGMA) for metastable diagram
@@ ============================================================
@@ We only want BCC_A2 and B2_221 phases
REJECT_PHASE FCC_A1
REJECT_PHASE SIGMA
REJECT_PHASE LIQUID

@@ Restore BCC phases
RESTORE_PHASE BCC_A2
RESTORE_PHASE B2_221

@@ List active phases
LIST_PHASE_STATUS

@@ ============================================================
@@ STEP 3: Set calculation conditions
@@ ============================================================
GO POLY

@@ Set reference state
SET_REFERENCE_STATE FE BCC_A2 * 1E5
SET_REFERENCE_STATE V BCC_A2 * 1E5

@@ ============================================================
@@ STEP 4: Calculate phase diagram
@@ ============================================================
GO MAP

@@ Set mapping conditions
SET_MAP_CONDITION 1 T 800 2000 25
SET_MAP_CONDITION 2 X(V) 0 1 0.02
SET_MAP_CONDITION P 101325

@@ Calculate the phase diagram
CALCULATE_MAP

@@ ============================================================
@@ STEP 5: Plot the phase diagram
@@ ============================================================
GO POST

@@ Set plot axes
SET_PLOT_AXIS X X(V) 0 1
SET_PLOT_AXIS Y T 800 2000

@@ Set plot title
SET_PLOT_TITLE Fe-V Metastable BCC Phase Diagram (BCC_A2 + B2_221)

@@ Plot the diagram
PLOT_DIAGRAM

@@ ============================================================
@@ STEP 6: Export data (optional)
@@ ============================================================
@@ Uncomment the following lines to export data
@@ EXPORT_DIAGRAM Fe-V_BCC_diagram.dat

@@ ============================================================
@@ Alternative: Step-by-step equilibrium calculation
@@ ============================================================
@@ If MAP doesn't work, use step equilibrium:
@@
@@ GO POLY
@@ SET_CONDITION P 101325
@@ SET_CONDITION N 1
@@ SET_CONDITION X(V) 0.5
@@ SET_CONDITION T 1000
@@ CALCULATE_EQUILIBRIUM
@@ LIST_EQUILIBRIUM

@@ ============================================================
@@ Notes:
@@ ============================================================
@@ - This macro creates a metastable BCC phase diagram
@@ - FCC_A1 and SIGMA phases are rejected (not considered)
@@ - Only BCC_A2 (disordered) and B2_221 (ordered) phases are active
@@ - Temperature range: 800-2000 K
@@ - Composition range: 0-100% V
@@ - The B2_221 phase uses 8 sublattices (2x2x1 supercell)
@@ - Formation energies are from DFT calculations (Book1.xlsx)
@@
@@ For questions, contact: satoshi minamoto
@@ ============================================================
